<OLI><SUB>FSI connection</SUB> to pump impeller bowl flange must be designed by the Contractors selected pump supplier 
and be rigid or flexible as indicated by results of the dynamic analysis required in paragraph DYNAMIC 
ANALYSIS.  Submit design and drawings indicating materials of construction and method of assembly of 
the FSI for approval.</OLI>]<BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
]<SPT><TTL>Flanges</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
